# Merch Console takes no configuration and holds no secrets.
#
# There is no backend, no API key and no analytics. The entire catalog, sales
# history and vendor receipt set are generated locally from a fixed seed, and
# the only persisted state is the user's own edits, in this browser's
# localStorage. This file exists to document that, so nobody has to read the
# source to find out whether something is missing.
#
# If the app ever grows a backend, credentials belong here as empty keys and
# never in committed source.
